    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/efd7600405fe91c69433363e0be96a53.poster.avif?t=1734079724\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/efd7600405fe91c69433363e0be96a53.webm?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/efd7600405fe91c69433363e0be96a53.mp4?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Naval Armada is a Sea battle for survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Captain, the sea is challenging you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead exciting MMORPG naval battles online, choose warships and control them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with friends against enemies and win epic battles of destroyers, cruisers and battleships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/3020f39f020d9cbce5bf5e2e87ef3d23.poster.avif?t=1734079724\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/3020f39f020d9cbce5bf5e2e87ef3d23.webm?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/3020f39f020d9cbce5bf5e2e87ef3d23.mp4?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your fighting style! Crazy battles in free mode or planned attacks in group battles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your ship into a real death machine! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accept the Naval battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/057e2b2ea23a1001ce621dd75368c201.poster.avif?t=1734079724\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/057e2b2ea23a1001ce621dd75368c201.webm?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/057e2b2ea23a1001ce621dd75368c201.mp4?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Lots warships! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Different classes of ships and different weapons. From light guns, to torpedoes and missiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique upgrade system for each ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Many battle arenas from different parts of the world are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Modern 3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Intuitive operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show your opponents what warships are capable of under the control of an experienced commander! The war will judge who is right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who are you? An ordinary captain out of thousands, or the one who is feared?  You won't know until you take the fight...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/efd7600405fe91c69433363e0be96a53.poster.avif?t=1734079724\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/efd7600405fe91c69433363e0be96a53.webm?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/efd7600405fe91c69433363e0be96a53.mp4?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Naval Armada is a Sea battle for survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Captain, the sea is challenging you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead exciting MMORPG naval battles online, choose warships and control them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with friends against enemies and win epic battles of destroyers, cruisers and battleships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/3020f39f020d9cbce5bf5e2e87ef3d23.poster.avif?t=1734079724\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/3020f39f020d9cbce5bf5e2e87ef3d23.webm?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/3020f39f020d9cbce5bf5e2e87ef3d23.mp4?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your fighting style! Crazy battles in free mode or planned attacks in group battles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your ship into a real death machine! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accept the Naval battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/057e2b2ea23a1001ce621dd75368c201.poster.avif?t=1734079724\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/057e2b2ea23a1001ce621dd75368c201.webm?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618620/extras/057e2b2ea23a1001ce621dd75368c201.mp4?t=1734079724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Lots warships! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Different classes of ships and different weapons. From light guns, to torpedoes and missiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique upgrade system for each ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Many battle arenas from different parts of the world are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Modern 3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Intuitive operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show your opponents what warships are capable of under the control of an experienced commander! The war will judge who is right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who are you? An ordinary captain out of thousands, or the one who is feared?  You won't know until you take the fight...</p>",
    "short_description": "The Battleships sends a challenge to you! Play with friends against the enemies and win epic battles on torpedo boat destroyers, cruisers and battleships! Build your own game strategy and leave opponents no chance!",
